UC93 .up.> UC91 : <<extend>>

note right of UC_EmailNotif
  Handles all system 
  email notifications
end note

note bottom of UC_Login
  JWT-based authentication
  with role validation
end note

note right of UC81
  Campaigns can be:
  - Email Marketing
  - Lead Generation
  - Product Launch
end note

